\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-15f371b3 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"85748\" data-id=\"15f371b3\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-682a75f5\" data-eae-slider=\"38219\" data-id=\"682a75f5\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-147f7b36 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"147f7b36\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">About the Australia Powerball Lottery\n</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-65f555db elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"53687\" data-id=\"65f555db\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-de6650b\" data-eae-slider=\"32436\" data-id=\"de6650b\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-744e787b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"744e787b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Lott, also called Thelott Enterprises, manages the </span><b>lottery Powerball Australia </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">and all other lotteries in the country, excluding Western Australia. It also operates the Monday and Wednesday Lotto, Oz Lotto, Super ‘66, and TattsLotto. </span></p><p> </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Australia Powerball currently has the largest prize pool and is one of Australia's most popular lotteries, with a whopping nine prize divisions.</span></p><p><br /><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">To play the Powerball, you need to select 7 </span><b>Australia Powerball lottery</b> <b>numbers </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">and a Powerball number. You can choose numbers from 1 to 35 for the standard pick, and from 1 to 20 for the Powerball.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-4754a207 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"67412\" data-id=\"4754a207\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-68fc0c1a\" data-eae-slider=\"96999\" data-id=\"68fc0c1a\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6870c79 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6870c79\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Australia Powerball Lottery FAQ</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-7a08206c elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-invisible\" data-eae-slider=\"69213\" data-id=\"7a08206c\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;motion_fx_motion_fx_scrolling&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;slideInUp&quot;,&quot;motion_fx_devices&quot;:[&quot;desktop&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;,&quot;mobile&quot;]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-wider\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-6fad4803\" data-eae-slider=\"6728\" data-id=\"6fad4803\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e99f44e elementor-widget elementor-widget-eael-adv-accordion\" data-id=\"e99f44e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"eael-adv-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t            <div class=\"eael-adv-accordion\" id=\"eael-adv-accordion-e99f44e\" data-scroll-on-click=\"no\" data-scroll-speed=\"300\" data-accordion-id=\"e99f44e\" data-accordion-type=\"accordion\" data-toogle-speed=\"300\">\n            <div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"how-to-play-australia-powerball-lottery\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2441\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How To Play Australia Powerball Lottery</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2441\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-labelledby=\"how-to-play-australia-powerball-lottery\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">You can play the Australia Powerball lottery in 4 different ways.</span></p><ul><li><h3><b>Standard Entry Types</b></h3></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">You can choose between Marked entries or QuickPicks.</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Marked entries let you decide how many games you want to play. You can also use your favorite numbers. You’re limited to 18 games in-store, or 50 if you complete your entry online.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">QuickPicks is the simplest way to play and generates a random selection of numbers.</span><p> </p></li></ul><ul><li><h3><b>PowerHit Entries</b></h3></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">PowerHit entries guarantee the Powerball number.</span></p><ul><li><h3><b>Pick Entries and System Entries</b></h3></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Pick and System entries provide higher chances of winning and qualify you to participate in other prize divisions.</span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Selecting Pick entry will guarantee you two winning numbers. </span></li></ul></td><td><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">System entries let you play more numbers than the standard pick of 7 allows.</span></li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">A PowerHit 5 Pick guarantees you the PowerBall and a winning number.</span></li></ul></td><td><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">You can choose between 8 and 20 extra numbers to add to your pick.</span></li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">A PowerHit 6 Pick gives you the PowerBall and two winning numbers.</span></li></ul></td><td><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">PowerHit System entries give you the PowerBall and let you choose and add between 8 and 15 numbers to your standard pick.</span></li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"where-can-i-find-the-latest-results-of-the-australia-powerball-lottery\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2442\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Where can I find the latest results of the Australia PowerBall lottery?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2442\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-labelledby=\"where-can-i-find-the-latest-results-of-the-australia-powerball-lottery\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">The draw takes place on Thursday nights and broadcasts at 8:30 PM Australia Eastern Time on Australia’s Channel 7. You can also see the latest </span><b>Australia PowerBall lottery results </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">on The Lott’s website.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"has-anyone-won-the-australia-powerball-jackpot\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2443\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Has anyone won the Australia PowerBall jackpot?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2443\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-labelledby=\"has-anyone-won-the-australia-powerball-jackpot\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Yes. Recently, someone won $20 million from Oz Lotto’s jackpot. You can find testimonials from </span><b>Australia PowerBall lottery winners</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> on The Lott’s website.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"how-can-i-check-my-australia-powerball-lottery-ticket\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2444\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How can I check my Australia PowerBall lottery ticket?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2444\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-labelledby=\"how-can-i-check-my-australia-powerball-lottery-ticket\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">You can check your ticket on an</span><b> Australia PowerBall lottery ticket scanner</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> at an outlet near you. You can also enter your ticket number and compare it against the</span> <span style=\"font-weight: 400\">results</span> <span style=\"font-weight: 400\">on the website.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"what-are-the-chances-of-winning-the-australia-powerball-lottery\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"5\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2445\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What are the chances of winning the Australia PowerBall lottery?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2445\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"5\" aria-labelledby=\"what-are-the-chances-of-winning-the-australia-powerball-lottery\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Several factors determine your odds of winning the Australia PowerBall lottery. You can view a comprehensive guide on the website that details the odds of winning in all nine divisions.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"when-is-the-next-australia-powerball-lottery-draw\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"6\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2446\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">When is the next Australia PowerBall lottery draw?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2446\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"6\" aria-labelledby=\"when-is-the-next-australia-powerball-lottery-draw\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">The next PowerBall lottery draw takes place this coming Thursday on Channel 7. Be sure to check the</span><b> results of the Australia PowerBall lottery</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> and see if you’ve won.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"overall-australia-powerball-lottery-review\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"7\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2447\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Overall Australia Powerball Lottery review?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2447\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"7\" aria-labelledby=\"overall-australia-powerball-lottery-review\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">All in all, this is one of the more exciting international lotteries out there, and it’s well worth a wager if you’re able to try it. Remember to visit The Lott’s website for more information. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">You can also download the </span><b>Australia Powerball lottery app </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">and try out other lottery games like Oz Lotto, Set For Life, and TattsLotto.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div></div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</sect